From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AltarsCN <337293323+Altars3668@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 18:09:30 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] include: Add evntcons.h, the tracing definitions evntrace.h
 and evntprov.h lacked, and ntdll's session functions.

EVENT_RECORD and its parts as the SDK has them; the logfile structures laid out as the SDK has them, the control
codes, TraceMessage's flags, MOF_FIELD, TRACE_ENABLE_CONTEXT, EventTraceGuid and the missing prototypes;
INVALID_PROCESSTRACE_HANDLE all ones for 32-bit code too, as a pointer cast makes it; the data descriptor's type and
EventDataDescCreate.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>

